    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nNow Viewing by Private Appointment - Stunning 3 Bedroom Duplex Show Units.\n\nPark Lane marks the next step in the evolution of Cherrywood Village, following the success of Cherry Lane. With the same commitment to quality, Evara presents a new collection of 1, 2, 3 and 4-bedroom homes that deliver on style, comfort, and sustainability launching soon.\n\nDiscover a better standard of living at Park Lane, the latest prestigious address in the wonderful new suburb of Cherrywood. Perfectly situated at the edge of Dublin City, in a picturesque spot between the mountains and the sea, Park Lane offers families of all sizes the opportunity to put down roots in a thriving community with excellent transport links and second-to-none amenities.\n\nPark Lane consists of attractive and spacious family homes built to an incredibly high standard. A combination of quality brickwork and render, and a variety of styles, gives these beautiful homes a sense of style and contemporary design rarely seen in new developments. There is an abundance of green space, including Cherrywood's three main parks, Tully Park, Beckett Park and Ticknick Park, adding to the allure of this development, and underlining the dedication to creating harmonious communities that work in a modern world.\n\nAs a new and well-planned suburb, Cherrywood Village, is bursting with all the amenities a growing family could need, amongst large public parks, schools, cycle and pedestrian routes and wildlife and heritage trails, offering future residents an instant sense of community. Cherrywood's close proximity to some of South Dublin's most well-known areas, including Cabinteely, Carrickmines, Killiney and Dundrum, gives even more choice when it comes to entertainment and education for all ages. Park Lane residents can access South Dublin's best facilities via the convenient Luas service, including Dundrum Town Centre and Dublin City Centre itself. With three dedicated Luas stops within walking distance from Park Lane, Brennanstown Laughanstown and Cherrywood the daily commute is fast and easy.\n\nUpon registering your details will be passed to Evara and Sherry FitzGerald. \n\nFor further details please visit https://evara.ie/privacy-policy/"
      },
